  "sections": {
    "review": {
      "summary": "Read the specification's Phase A (A00-A12), sections 6-9 and 11 (estimators, unequal halves, clustered resampling, multiple comparisons, required reports and plots, tests T12-T14, T21-T24, T28), the phase 1 code (observations, reliability, provenance, dvp.py) and receipts. Inputs: the audit run phase1-audit-20261124T021910Z observations on repaired index 6ffb62fb (31,668 cells, 31,610 valid) and its schedule. matplotlib and scipy are absent; plots will be deterministic SVG written by the lab, and estimators use numpy (installed). The athlete and D/ST target tables carry per-rule contributions, which allow the FFA-component decomposition (A09) without a new data family; true opportunity counts would need a new realized-statistics source and are left to Phase B/C.",
