      "summary": "lab.py: position frames (entity = defense, or offense for D/ST; faced = the other side); adjustments none/season/loo_mean/loo_median/loo_shrunk; split assignments calendar/alternating/chronological/first6_next6/home_away/random (numpy, seeded); method-of-moments and REML one-way components with unequal sizes, boundary and convergence; lag-binned ICC; rolling-window correlations with model-implied values; carryover with slope and leave-one-pair-out CV; within-week permutation nulls; season, unit and franchise cluster bootstraps; jackknife influence. svg.py: deterministic plots. provenance: a contributions source spec for A09. dvp.py reliability subcommand writing reliability-results.json, plots and run artifacts; registry records for A00-A10, A12. Tests T12-T14, T23, T24, T28 plus determinism. Then RELIABILITY_REPORT.md and METHODOLOGY.md written from the results.",
